WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.340
A small biplane climbs through the clouds.

2
00:00:03.390 --> 00:00:09.030
Its pilot speaks calmly: "I know that I
shall meet my fate" "Somewhere among the

3
00:00:09.080 --> 00:00:13.180
clouds above;" He is
certain he will die up here.

4
00:00:13.230 --> 00:00:14.890
He doesn't hate the enemy.

5
00:00:14.940 --> 00:00:17.190
He doesn't love the side he guards.

6
00:00:17.240 --> 00:00:20.720
So if he expects to die,
and doesn't care who wins,

7
00:00:20.770 --> 00:00:22.910
why is he up there at all?

8
00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:25.240
In this mission, you'll find out why W.

9
00:00:25.290 --> 00:00:25.480
B.

10
00:00:25.530 --> 00:00:28.700
Yeats gives his airman
a tiny home country:

11
00:00:28.750 --> 00:00:30.800
Kiltartan, in Ireland.

12
00:00:30.850 --> 00:00:35.890
You'll cross off, one by one, every
reason he says did not make him fight.

13
00:00:35.940 --> 00:00:39.540
And you'll watch his lines
balance, like a pair of scales.

14
00:00:39.590 --> 00:00:43.310
Your mission: explain why
he doesn't care who wins.
